[node name="GardenBed" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "A dug vegetable bed, 1.2 x 4 m (along Z), edged with boards on pegs (tools/build/prop_abbey_yard.py), in November. Model shows one of four by where the bed stands: bare ridged earth; cabbage stumps; leeks and lifted onions; bean poles pulled and left (set its pick to choose). The hidden Block is its footprint; it is walked through."

